# rel_split arguments that reproduce the golden split of option.
# option dispatches ~35 of its handlers only through the .data fn-ptr table
# at lbl_0000C640, so rel_split auto-detects just 47 of the 71 real starts.
# Pass --extra-start-file tools/rel_split_args/option.starts as well, or the
# re-split silently merges those handlers into their predecessors.
#
# usage: python tools/rel_split.py option $(grep -v "^#" tools/rel_split_args/option.args)

